Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:22:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [GLES] Bound ASS subtitle atlases to the GPU texture limit

Split subtitle images into ordered atlas pages so complex ASS typesetting
cannot exceed GL_MAX_TEXTURE_SIZE. Preserve bitmap contents and drawing
order, including images larger than one page.

(cherry picked from commit 5204178285f93f9e5fd35df456ea780f52b0f075)
(cherry picked from commit 077aa9d3af6ab02fff18c394079e3c2834e8fa94)
